Description: desktop remote control for Denon and Marantz receivers
 Controls a Denon or Marantz network receiver over the local network. The
 window follows changes made on the front panel, the infrared remote or the
 HEOS app.
 .
 Power, volume, mute and input for up to three zones, surround modes, Quick
 Select, tone and subwoofer trim, dynamic range, Restorer, ECO, sleep timer
 and the on-screen setup menu. Receivers are found on the network
 automatically; a tray icon gives power, mute and volume.
